        <mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Boundaries:&lt;/b&gt; The desktop initiates outbound connections; no inbound shop port. Rooms derive from authenticated shop membership.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Durability:&lt;/b&gt; PostgreSQL owns business state. Redis executes work. SQLite records local submission attempts.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Printing:&lt;/b&gt; Staff click Print. Spooler acceptance is not physical completion. Reconnect never automatically reprints an uncertain attempt." vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f3f5f8;strokeColor=#8390a3;fontColor=#17263c;fontSize=12;spacing=7;arcSize=12;shape=text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;fontSize=13;fontStyle=0;">
