        <mxCell id="rules" value="&lt;b&gt;Recovery rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Payment UNKNOWN → SUCCEEDED / FAILED only after provider evidence. A timeout does not release the charge lock.&lt;br&gt;• Print UNKNOWN → staff review of OS queue and paper. A reprint is a new, audited attempt, explicitly authorized.&lt;br&gt;• Device reservations never expire into automatic reassignment while offline printing is possible.&lt;br&gt;• Reassignment / refund requires quiescing the original device and resolving its pending print attempts.&lt;br&gt;• Unpaid jobs may expire or be cancelled. Paid exceptions enter FULFILMENT_REVIEW; money remains recorded separately.&lt;br&gt;• REFUND_PENDING / REFUNDED are refund records, not a reversal of a successful payment record." vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f3f5f8;strokeColor=#8390a3;fontColor=#17263c;fontSize=12;spacing=7;arcSize=12;shape=text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;fontSize=13;fontStyle=0;">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="810" width="1250" height="185" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
